# held/civil/ledger: the ledger (art weapon 10) at rest, carried by its top edge in the near hand (PROPS, P2b): a thick
# account book in a pale vellum binding, its spine and corners in the person's leather, a brass clasp on a strap.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. On the grip (the fist's top-left) and the held channel (LOCO and RUN; `drop` by a corpse);
# the fist is drawn over its top edge (it sits under armNear). Front and right: the front board face-on, the spine toward
# the body; back: the back board; left (the far hand, hidden): only its lower corner behind the legs.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held ledger
layer neck
anchor grip
keys held
z 40

view D key rest origin 2 -1
|fVVVVf
|fYYXXV
|fYXXWV
|fXIOXV
|fXXWWV
|ffVVVf

view U key rest origin 0 -1 layer heldBack
|fVVVVf
|VYXXWf
|VXXXWf
|VXXWWf
|VXWWWf
|fVVVff

view R key rest origin 1 -1
|fVVVVVf
|fYYXXXV
|fYXXXWV
|fXXIOXV
|fXXXWWV
|ffVVVVf

view L key rest origin -3 -3 layer heldBack
|VVVVf
|XXWWf
|XWWWf
|VVVff

# (INTEGRATION 2026-10-23) running, the far hand pumps (its handR mark on every pump key): the ledger hangs from that
# fist by its top edge, not from the idle's hidden hand 3 px off it (W5: it floated behind the knees)
view L key rest origin 2 -1 layer heldBack when run replace
|VVVVf
|XXWWf
|XWWWf
|VVVff

view D key rest origin 0 0 when posture replace
|.

view U key rest origin 0 0 when posture replace
|.

view R key rest origin 0 0 when posture replace
|.

view L key rest origin 0 0 when posture replace
|.

view L key drop origin 3 2
|.VVVVVf.
|VYXXXXWf
|VXIOXWWf
|fVVVVVff
